#: ../../../variable/CMAKE_AIX_SHARED_LIBRARY_SYMLINKS.rst:6
msgid ""
"On AIX, enable or disable :prop_tgt:`VERSION` and :prop_tgt:`SOVERSION` file "
"names for plain shared objects."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../variable/CMAKE_AIX_SHARED_LIBRARY_SYMLINKS.rst:9
msgid ""
"This variable initializes the :prop_tgt:`AIX_SHARED_LIBRARY_SYMLINKS` target "
"property on non-imported ``SHARED`` library targets as they are created "
"by :command:`add_library`.  See that target property for details."
msgstr ""
